<title>About | Jasdeep Dhillon</title>
<MainLayout>
    <section class="m-8 max-w-4xl p-8 mx-auto">

        <h3 class="text-3xl font-pixelify p-4 text-center">
            About Me
        </h3>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-pretty">

            <div>
                Hi, I’m Jasdeep.
            </div>
            <div>
                I’m someone who enjoys figuring things out especially when it comes to technology, problem-solving, and building things that actually work. Whether it’s digging into code, troubleshooting an issue, or exploring new ideas, I like getting hands-on and learning by doing.
            </div>
            <div>
                I tend to approach challenges with curiosity and persistence. If something doesn’t work the first time, I’ll keep refining it until it does. That mindset has shaped how I learn and how I work: practical, focused, and always improving.
            </div>
            <div>
                I’m particularly interested in computers and software—understanding how systems function, how to optimize them, and how to create solutions that are both efficient and reliable. I value clarity, simplicity, and results.
            </div>
            <div>
                Outside of that, I keep things straightforward. I prefer meaningful work over noise, and progress over perfection.
            </div>
            This page is a snapshot of who I am right now—always learning, always building, and always moving forward.
        </div>

    </section>
</MainLayout>
